1. The Technical Team as referred to in Article 9 letter j shall consist of officials who understand gender responsive budget analysis.
2. The Regional Gender Mainstreaming regional action plan as referred to in Article 9 letter k shall contain:
   a. Gender mainstreaming in regional laws and regulations;  
   b. Gender mainstreaming in the development cycle in the Region;  
   c. strengthening of Gender Mainstreaming institutions in the Region; and  
   d. strengthening community participation in the Region.

#### Article 11

1. The Gender Mainstreaming Focal Point in each Regional Apparatus Organization as referred to in Article 9 letter l shall consist of officials and/or staff responsible for planning and/or programs.  
2. The Gender Mainstreaming Focal Point as referred to in paragraph (1) has the following duties:
   a. promoting Gender Mainstreaming in the work unit;  
   b. facilitating the preparation of work plans and budgeting of Regional Apparatus Organizations that are gender responsive;  
